{"id":5085,"date":"2025-08-10T21:48:00","date_gmt":"2025-08-10T12:18:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?page_id=5085"},"modified":"2025-10-26T16:48:29","modified_gmt":"2025-10-26T07:18:29","slug":"partner-program-for-agencies","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/partner-program-for-agencies\/","title":{"rendered":"partner-program-for-agencies"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"5085\" class=\"elementor elementor-5085\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-135bf17 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"135bf17\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43a147b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"43a147b\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-63c78a6 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"63c78a6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;sticky&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;sticky_on&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;],&quot;sticky_parent&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;sticky_offset&quot;:0,&quot;sticky_effects_offset&quot;:0,&quot;sticky_anchor_link_offset&quot;:0}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2335400 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"2335400\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d67c581 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d67c581\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Built for Agencies, Consultants &amp; Commerce Platforms<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c2679bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c2679bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">FeedOps Partner Program\n<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1319a40 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"1319a40\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Work with a team that treats product data like a growth strategy\u2014not admin.\n<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b8364ed e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b8364ed\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d8cdba elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7d8cdba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Partners Choose FeedOps<\/h4>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a555bec elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a555bec\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We support ecommerce experts who want to deliver better results without increasing media spend. Whether you run media, manage stores, or build ecommerce tech, FeedOps becomes your behind-the-scenes feed team\u2014powered by AI, backed by experts.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What makes us different:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Channel-Optimized Feeds<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for Google, Meta, Microsoft, Amazon, and more<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>AI-Driven Enhancements<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to titles, attributes, and structure<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Always-On Diagnostics<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to fix feed issues before they affect campaigns<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Collaborative Setup<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> that aligns with your workflows and protects your client relationships<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><b>Is This a Fit for You?<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We work best with partners who:<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2705 Support online retailers who care about performance<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2705 Work with stores that advertise across Shopping, Social, or Marketplaces<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2705 Want to grow their client base by delivering measurable results<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2705 Value strategy and execution\u2014not just another plug-in<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019re working with stores serious about optimization and ready for more efficient performance, we\u2019d love to connect.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fda94c2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fda94c2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad9df28 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ad9df28\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"partner-form\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;sticky&quot;:&quot;top&quot;,&quot;sticky_parent&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;sticky_on&quot;:[&quot;desktop&quot;,&quot;laptop&quot;,&quot;tablet&quot;,&quot;mobile&quot;],&quot;sticky_offset&quot;:0,&quot;sticky_effects_offset&quot;:0,&quot;sticky_anchor_link_offset&quot;:0}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9aa72d9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9aa72d9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><b>Request the FeedOps Partner Info Pack<\/b><\/h3>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78b2969 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"78b2969\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fill in a few quick details so we can tailor the info pack to your needs.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4e7f64 elementor-widget elementor-widget-hubspot-form\" data-id=\"c4e7f64\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"hubspot-form.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\twindow.hsFormsOnReady = window.hsFormsOnReady || [];\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\twindow.hsFormsOnReady.push(()=>{\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thbspt.forms.create({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tportalId: 20083726,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tformId: \"a1b088c9-a1f9-4681-96f8-f4178d7e1088\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttarget: \"#hbspt-form-1780280729000-3393273316\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tregion: \"na1\",\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})});\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/script>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"hbspt-form\" id=\"hbspt-form-1780280729000-3393273316\"><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-03f6bf2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"03f6bf2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c3c8dd e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7c3c8dd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6cd57a2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6cd57a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fc414bd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fc414bd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>Why Retailers &amp; Agencies Choose FeedOps<\/strong><\/h3><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p><b>More Outcomes, Not Overheads<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps transforms your product feed into your most powerful sales asset. We combine AI, automation, and expert support to deliver optimized product data that drives visibility, conversions, and return on ad spend\u2014across every major channel.<\/span><\/p><h3><b>One Feed. Every Channel.<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We unify and optimize product data for:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Google Shopping &amp; Performance Max<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Microsoft Ads &amp; Bing Shopping<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Meta, TikTok, Pinterest<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Amazon, eBay, and other marketplaces<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Local Inventory Ads to drive in-store sales<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><b>What We Deliver<\/b><\/h3><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>More Sales<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Optimized visibility that drives clicks and conversions<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Better ROAS<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Smarter targeting powered by enriched product data<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Less Waste<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Eliminate spend on irrelevant or low-quality traffic<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Faster Time to Value<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Always-on optimization and automated fixes<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><h3><b>Built for Today\u2019s Ad Ecosystem<\/b><\/h3><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps uses Large Language Models (LLMs) to:<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rewrite product titles and descriptions in natural language<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Fill missing attributes and optimize product categorization<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Align feeds with buyer intent and trending search terms<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Monitor and resolve issues in real time, across all platforms<\/span><p>\u00a0<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><b>\u201cYour campaigns aren\u2019t broken\u2014your feed is.\u201d<\/b><\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1364b10 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"1364b10\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cdc0f74 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"cdc0f74\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-422a6d0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"422a6d0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3><strong>Why Retailers &amp; Agencies Choose FeedOps\u00a0<br \/><br \/><\/strong><\/h3><ol><li><h4><b>Trusted by Leading Agencies &amp; Ecommerce Experts<\/b><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">FeedOps powers the product feeds behind millions of listings and ad impressions across the world\u2019s top shopping and discovery platforms.<\/span><\/p><h4><b>Why Partners Choose FeedOps<\/b><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u2705 We align to your campaign strategy\u2014not compete with it<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u2705 We plug in as your feed optimization team, behind the scenes<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u2705 We support your process\u2014whether it\u2019s referral, white-label, or co-managed<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u2705 We free your team from feed admin, so they can focus on growth<\/span><\/p><h4><b>Partner Incentives &amp; Support<\/b><\/h4><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udcb8 <\/span><b>20% Ongoing Referral Fee<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Earn revenue for the life of any client you refer to FeedOps.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83e\udd1d <\/span><b>Flexible Collaboration<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> From silent support to co-branded offerings\u2014we tailor our model to yours.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udcc8 <\/span><b>Real Results<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Our AI-first approach delivers measurable uplifts in sales, CTR, and ROAS\u2014without increasing ad spend.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udce3 <\/span><b>Joint Marketing Opportunities<\/b><b><br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We\u2019re open to collaborating on shared case studies, events, and content that showcase your success.<\/span><\/p><h4><b>Let\u2019s Talk<\/b><\/h4><p><b>Book a meeting<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to discuss how we can work together and grow your clients\u2019 performance\u2014without growing overhead.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><a href=\"\/book-live-demo\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Book a Meeting<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Or email us at <\/span><b>sales@feedops.com<\/b><\/p><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Built for Agencies, Consultants &amp; Commerce Platforms FeedOps Partner Program Work with a team that treats product data like a growth strategy\u2014not admin. Why Partners Choose FeedOps We support ecommerce experts who want to deliver better results without increasing media spend. Whether you run media, manage stores, or build ecommerce tech, FeedOps becomes your behind-the-scenes [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":11,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-5085","page","type-page","status-